{"product_id":"cafe-colombia-grano-especialidad","title":"Café Origen Colombia","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCafé de grano \u0026amp; molido origen Colombia\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [\u0026amp;:has([data-writing-block])\u0026gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:8e4630d5-3914-461a-b2b8-640dd0f07a15-0\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-2\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm\/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"d267e9ba-3d6d-4804-9b71-c61aaac33e7b\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"383\"\u003eCafé de especialidad proveniente de \u003cspan class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"whitespace-normal\"\u003eColombia\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, de la región de \u003cspan class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"whitespace-normal\"\u003eBelén de Umbría\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, específicamente de la finca Samaria, liderada por la familia Osorio. Este café ofrece un perfil acaramelado, con matices cítricos, notas a panela y chocolate, clásicos del café colombiano, culminando en una taza limpia y balanceada.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"535\"\u003eEs un café de variedad Tabi, de proceso lavado con fermentación de 12 horas y secado al sol, encarnando toda la tradición colombiana.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"736\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003ePreparalo en métodos filtrados o en espresso. Destaca por su gran versatilidad y merece ser disfrutado en distintos momentos, brindando una experiencia única en cada sorbo.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Blackdrop Coffee","offers":[{"title":"227 GRAMOS \/ GRANO","offer_id":47403909349658,"sku":"CGRA2032","price":13990.0,"currency_code":"CLP","in_stock":true},{"title":"227 GRAMOS \/ MOLIDO","offer_id":47403909382426,"sku":"CMOL2051","price":13990.0,"currency_code":"CLP","in_stock":true},{"title":"1 KILO \/ GRANO","offer_id":47301140545818,"sku":"CGRA2029","price":41990.0,"currency_code":"CLP","in_stock":true},{"title":"1 KILO \/ MOLIDO","offer_id":47301140611354,"sku":"CMOL2048","price":41990.0,"currency_code":"CLP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0784\/1395\/5354\/files\/cafe-origen-colombia-6094340.png?v=1778077516","url":"https:\/\/blackdrop.cl\/products\/cafe-colombia-grano-especial